- **AUC(0–tlast)** : {{call_2.auclast}}
- **AUC(0–inf)** : {{call_2.aucinf.obs}}
- **λz** : {{call_2.lambda.z}} (R² = {{call_2.lambda_z_regression.r_squared}}, 5 points entre {{call_2.lambda_z_regression.time_first}} h et {{call_2.lambda_z_regression.time_last}} h)
- **t½** : {{call_2.half.life}}
